                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-2__amdact-2__item-1__qstr-1__para-a">
                    <num>a</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>the dealings proposed to be authorised by the licence are limited to one or more of the following for purposes relating to disposing of a GMO:</p>
                    </content>
