                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-2__amdact-2__item-2__qstr-1__para-ii">
                    <num>ii</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>propagating the GMO;</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-2__amdact-2__item-2__qstr-1__para-iii">
                    <num>iii</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>growing, raising or culturing the GMO;</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-2__amdact-2__item-2__qstr-1__para-iv">
                    <num>iv</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>transporting the GMO;</p>
                    </content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-2__amdact-2__item-2__qstr-1__para-v">
                    <num>v</num>
                    <content>
