                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-5__amdact-5__item-2__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>an application for variation of a licence made on or after the commencement of this item; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__part-5__amdact-5__item-2__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>an application for variation of a licence made, but not decided, before that commencement.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </hcontainer>
            </hcontainer>
